# Ask a verifier (typically a VLM) whether the evidence collected for one
# candidate object shows the claimed object. All images travel in one request
# (e.g. per view a full frame with the candidate outlined plus a crop) so the
# model answers once over the combined evidence.
string object_name
string[] query_variants       # alternative phrasings of object_name, optional
sensor_msgs/Image[] images
string[] captions             # one per image, e.g. "view 2: full frame, candidate outlined in red"
---
grasplan/Verdict verdict
